      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "Reporting time fell by **40% in the résumé, 60% on LinkedIn**—which is correct, what was measured, and whose result was it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "fraudshield-not-real-time",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "For each, was it a course project, prototype or live product?"
    },
    {
      "id": "autopilot-is-a-script",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "Prototype/live product; actual behavior; current status; team and own part; evidence and display rights"
    },
    {
      "id": "efficiency-35-unmeasured",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "What improved by **35%**, over what period, how was it measured, and was that your result or a team’s?"
    },
    {
      "id": "bank-confidential",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "What screenshots, documents, photographs or diagrams are available, who made or owns them, and which may appear publicly? What must stay private?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rent-map-3000-or-5000",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "Was it **3,000 or 5,000 monthly visitors**, or figures from different periods?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msc-dates",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "Did your MSc end in **2021 or 2022**?"
    },
    {
